\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Statistical validation of the hidden Markov model with jumps (HMM-WJ)} ($N = 100$, $\alpha = 0.05$). Panels (a) and (d) condition on the $\sim \!24\%$ of in-sample paths containing jump events. (a)~In-sample KS $p$-values for $239$ jump paths (pass rate $93.7\%$). (b)~Out-of-sample KS $p$-values for all $1{,}000$ paths (pass rate $95.4\%$). (c)~Out-of-sample density fan chart; the observed density falls within the simulation envelope. (d)~Observed and mean simulated in-sample autocorrelation function (ACF) of $|G_t|$ for jump paths.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
